ce: pre-wrap;\">于是一人一龙，闯秘境、战试炼、灭强敌，惊动龙裔亲自接见，不朽秘法拱手奉上。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">神明绝罚降落，魔王舍身破局，焚天煮海，以无敌龙威，铸不朽真谛！</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\"></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">——「这次记得带上武器了吗，我的大魔王？」</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">「吼吼，我已经参悟了龙锤合一，利爪与双翼完美代替重锤的击打与飞行！」</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">「所以我的意思是，锤子又忘带了。」</p></div> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"valkyrie\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-valkyrie obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器展示</h2> <ul data-target=\"skill.items\" class=\"obc-tmpl__switch-btn-list\"><li data-target=\"skill.items\" data-index=\"0\" class=\"obc-tmpl__switch-btn obc-tmpl__switch-btn--active\">\n      初始外观\n    </li><li data-target=\"skill.items\" data-index=\"1\" class=\"obc-tmpl__switch-btn\">\n      满星外观\n    </li><li data-target=\"skill.items\" data-index=\"2\" class=\"obc-tmpl__switch-btn\">\n      实机展示\n    </li></ul> <ul data-target=\"skill.items\" class=\"obc-tmpl__switch-list\" style=\"height: 115px;\"><li data-target=\"skill.items\" data-index=\"0\" class=\"obc-tmpl__switch-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-title\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2025/07/07/50494840/49399dbc4605b7851fd00da54d138877_5329811012310061394.png\" alt=\"\"> <span>火箭锤</span></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table style=\"border-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height:1;font-size:16px;min-width:25px;border-collapse:collapse;\" class=\"\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\"><colgroup><col></colgroup><tbody><tr><td><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2025/