A%E8%BA%AB%E7%82%B9%E7%87%83%E7%A7%AF%E8%93%84%E5%80%BC%E7%9A%84%E9%99%84%E5%8A%A0%E6%95%88%E7%8E%87%E3%80%82%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1768573036883\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"role\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--role obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>适用角色</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__role-table\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\"><div class=\"role-icon-td\"><div><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2025/07/21/50494840/27f256d8d36575d064da4328f32a94c8_1488101265483790180.png\" alt=\"\"></div> <span>逆命魔龙·降临！</span></div></td> <td><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__role-stars\"><span>推荐指数</span> <div><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">最佳推荐武器。全方面提高输出和辅助能力，并提高点燃积蓄值的附加效率。</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"review\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--review obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器测评</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">【同调技能】提高敌人受到来自场上角色造成的全伤（独立加成、唯一生效）。逆命魔龙·降临！装备时为敌人施加来自自身的火易伤（独立加成）。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\"></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">【通用性能】常驻点燃增伤，并为敌人施加来自自身的全易伤，佩戴者具有万有之星特性时火伤提高。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">【角色相性】<span style=\"color:rgba(64,64,64,1)\">逆命魔龙·降临！</span>装备且激活星之环时，<span style=\"color:rgba(64,64,64,1)\">施加来自自身的全易伤、</span>为敌人施加全易伤和<span style=\"color:rgba(64,64,64,1)\">来自自身的火易伤</span>，并且提高自身点燃积蓄值的附加效率。</p></div> <!----></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
